### ============================================================
### PASSO 4: Gerar QR Codes para conexão (rodar no cliente)
### ============================================================

### QR Porto Alemão
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/connect/porto-alemao
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}

###

### QR Felix Cell
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/connect/felix-cell
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}

###

### QR Miranda Informática  
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/connect/miranda-informatica
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}

###

### QR Leandro Bazar
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/connect/leandro-bazar
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}

###

### QR Marmitaria Cleo
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/connect/marmitaria-cleo
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}

###

### QR Padaria São Jorge
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/connect/padaria-sao-jorge
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}

###

### QR Paulo Tapeceiro
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/connect/paulo-tapeceiro
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}

### ============================================================
### PASSO 5: Verificar status de todas as instâncias
### ============================================================
GET {{evolutionUrl}}/instance/fetchInstances
apikey: {{globalApiKey}}
